    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "怎么，你在恐惧一个年老体弱，手无寸铁的普通人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "你可不是什么手无寸铁的“普通人”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "你是磁山二号实验室的首席科学家，列维·克里奇科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "不准靠近那些设备。我知道你想干什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "闪击，把他的手铐起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "收到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "我得说，你们的动作非常快......快到令人敬佩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "但是还不够快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "反应堆启动了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "这些黑色的石头在发光！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "让它停下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "不好意思，这可做不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "让它停下来！立刻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈......哈哈哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "它不会停下的，你就尽管开枪吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "我一生的心血都倾注在这个项目上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "如果不是因为那些目光短浅的无能之辈一次又一次的阻挠......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "二十年前，我就该完成这一切了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "你根本不知道自己在做什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "这个实验室里的设备破旧不堪，你正在制造一场核污染灾难！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "我当然知道我在做什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "探索科学的道路充满艰难险阻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "但是探索是值得的，对真理的探寻绝对值得，永远都值得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "我不过是要拿回那早在二十年前就应当属于我的成果，谁都别想阻止我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "......该死的雇佣兵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "text": "你还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "呃，只是抱怨一下，刚才差一点就被打到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "我们本可以和其他干员一起进入主实验室的！",
