    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "你还好吗，科恩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "这里是什么地方......出什么事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这个问题问得好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "text": "......列维启动了设备之后，整个实验室都被剧烈的冲击波席卷了。",
