    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "结束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "这是什么鬼东西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "啊，这算是可以喘口气了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "哈——呼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "哇哦，刚才可真险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这里真的还是地球吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我是指，我们熟悉的那个星球？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "没理由觉得不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "但我们要做好最坏的准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "墙彻底塌了，这里已经连掩体都算不上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "转移吧，直到我们找到能落脚的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
